message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "tes-destripe: orbit-track destriping of MGS TES global maps"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-12
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/euchas/tes-destripe"
url: "https://github.com/euchas/tes-destripe"
authors:
  - family-names: Valantinas
    given-names: Adomas
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9995-3335"
    affiliation: "University of Cambridge"
keywords:
  - Mars
  - Mars Global Surveyor
  - TES
  - Dust Cover Index
  - destriping
  - Fourier filter
  - PDS3
  - GeoTIFF
abstract: >-
  Removes the orbit-track striping from Mars Global Surveyor Thermal Emission
  Spectrometer (TES) global maps with a latitude-adaptive directional Fourier
  filter, reading attached-label PDS3/ISIS2 QUBE products (or any raster) and
  writing georeferenced GeoTIFFs on the standard Mars equirectangular grid.
